      "gaps": [
        "Texel layout inside a probe is equi-area spherical with a per-level trace resolution; an upsampled trace writes the same value into an UpsampleFactor x UpsampleFactor footprint (LumenRadianceCache.usf:900-921), so texels are not independent samples.",
